a179-a6dda82abfa0)) (text "R612 carries passive dry from FX_RETURN to MIX_OUT. R618 adds wet through 1M.\nDry gain is independent of RV602 and K3, but passive loading causes fixed attenuation.\nNo dry audio passes through U10/U11/U12. Original C19/R24 and phase inverter remain.\nPCB layout must change; the old 160 x 100 board is not this circuit. Cabinet is already delivered." (at 20 285 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 38bcac59-5466-5b30-9895-a380e917b723)))
